d 'WXSUM': module to process temperature and precipitation data
d
d      wxsum processes remote sensing rainfall and temperature data
d and outputs useful seasonal statistics. It can    be used with
d either rainfall or temperature data from any source. 
d
d KW: climate
d KW: temperature
d KW: rainfall
d KW: precipitation
d
d Requires: Stata version 15.1
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261102
d
d Author:  Jeffrey D. Michler,  University of Arizona
d Support: email jdmichler@@arizona.edu
d
d Author:  Anna Josephson, University of Arizona 
d Support: email aljosephson@@arizona.edu
d
d Author: Oscar Barriga-Cabanillas, World Bank 
d Support: email obarriga@@worldbank.org
d
d Author: Aleksandr Michuda,  Swarthmore College 
d Support: email amichud1@@swarthmore.edu
d
d Author: Jeffrey C. Oliver,  University of Arizona 
d Support: email jcoliver@@arizona.edu
d
f wxsum.ado
f wxsum.sthlp
f wxprep.ado
f wxprep.sthlp
f ../h/hh_panel.dta
f ../m/make_example_data.do
f weather_hourly.dta
f wxsum_births.dta
f wxsum_examples.do
f wxsum_examples.log
f wxsum_rain.dta
f wxsum_temp.dta
